{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9941130a-21b4-5575-9a9a-e678654ac3c2", "source_ordinal": 304, "reading_ordinal": 3753, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无苦之乐", "published_at": "2026-02-21T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/1796c90c06c911f1b3445254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "爱时常会有牺牲，但出于爱的牺牲本身一定是甜蜜的、快乐的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "它更类似辛勤的熬制美味的羹汤给心爱的人喝，小心的攒钱给心爱的人购买礼物，或者不辞辛劳帮助爱人克服某个难关、战胜某个灾难。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我身虽累，我心虽苦，但总有你的安全和微笑令我释然，让我觉得一切都值得。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我是如此爱你，你对我就如有神奇的魔法，只要看到你痛苦紧皱的眉头轻轻的松解，看到你终于平息了焦躁而安然的睡去，我就有多么的满足和放松。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我之前是多么为你担忧啊，你知道吗？", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你什么都不肯告诉我，我知道你打的什么主意——因为你怕我担心，怕耽误我的快乐。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为你爱我，你怕你的苦难成为我的负担。你盘算着默默爱我，直到你爱不动了，就悄悄消失。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你真的傻，你以为我想要什么？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我只想要一个有你的未来。在这个未来里，你愿意做什么、能做什么，就去做；不愿意做什么、不能做什么，就不做。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我已经想过，就算你现在瘫痪了，甚至眼不能动、口不能言，只要还有可以挽回生命的可能，我都不会有抛弃你、离开你的一天。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你在我眼里，就是这样的珍贵。你过往所做的，已经足够我下定这样的决心。你已经不需要再证明什么，再补偿我什么了。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我唯一的要求，就是你不要再担心，再为所谓的“拖累我”而自恨、自残，甚至打着什么“归还自由”的混账主意！", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "还我什么自由？？", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我本来就是自由的，我现在就是自由的，我已经是自由的决定要如此做。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我不允许你打着这么“高尚”的旗号抛弃我，不允许你想象我没了你这个“累赘”会更快乐！", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我不允许！你听到了吗？", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我不会更快乐！我不会的！", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你怎么能这么傲慢和自私，只在你能给我带来幸福、带来温暖的时候与我同行，尽情享受为我牺牲、救我于水火的快乐，却在你自己哪怕稍微需要帮助、稍微无力的时候就自视为累赘，想要“悄悄消失”？", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 725}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你比谁都知道，为所爱的人奉献和牺牲、支撑、滋养和挽救所爱的人，其实是人生的幸福。", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你比谁都知道。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 774}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那为什么轮到你需要被支撑、被滋养、被挽救了，你却连机会也不愿给我？难道你是害怕寄托了这样的希望，我会让你失望吗？", "char_start": 775, "char_end": 831}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你就当我是有“没你不行”的病吧——我真的有这样的病，而且病入膏肓。", "char_start": 832, "char_end": 865}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "就算为了我，哪怕痛苦，你也坚持下去好吗？", "char_start": 866, "char_end": 886}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你别气馁，别担心，更别把自己看得一无是处。", "char_start": 887, "char_end": 908}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我知道你有多好，有多善良，有多强大。", "char_start": 909, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我一生眼高于顶，见识过多少雅客高士、枭雄豪强，我岂是无缘无故爱上你的呢？", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你把我看得多愚蠢，多没有眼光呢？", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "好了，你别再说什么没法给我多少回报的事了。", "char_start": 982, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "其实，若是没有你，我应该早就不在了。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你知道吗？", "char_start": 1023, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "我原本对这个世界已经绝望，对人已经没有期待了。我之所以没有直接选择结束，只是因为父母尚在，不愿令ta们担心而已。然而就算是这样的所谓“坚持”，其实我也知道并不能支撑我到多久。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1116}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "其实我是被你从死里拔出来的。", "char_start": 1117, "char_end": 1131}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "就那么轻轻松松的、毫不费力的、仿佛天注定似的，一下子拔出来了。", "char_start": 1132, "char_end": 1163}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "我本无法呼吸，一下可以呼吸了。", "char_start": 1164, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "我本无法吃喝，一下可以吃喝了。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "我本已在黑暗中迷失，一下便看见了。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "我本将死，因你而活转了。", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "所以你不要再说什么“回报”的话了——还有什么回报，大过我侥幸捡回的这段生命呢？", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1266}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "何况，你也不要担心我会不吃不喝、放下一切的自苦，我自会照顾好自己，会保持健康、会自得其乐。", "char_start": 1267, "char_end": 1312}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你只需要乖乖的，不要再自我怀疑、自我折磨，让我为你所做的努力打折、受损，就是对我最大的报答了。", "char_start": 1313, "char_end": 1360}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "是的，我知道连这现在对你都很难，而我也还没有我想象的那么耐心和温柔，有时可能会无意的抱怨，会让你怀疑我的甘愿。", "char_start": 1361, "char_end": 1416}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "但我们耐心一点，慢慢适应好吗？", "char_start": 1417, "char_end": 1432}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你爱了我，也请给我机会来爱你。", "char_start": 1433, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "给了，我有所辜负，也请你再给。", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1464}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "我不痛苦，真的，你不要替我觉得痛苦。", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1483}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "你再说这话，我真的要打你了。", "char_start": 1484, "char_end": 1498}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "上面这些，才是爱胜于痛苦，抹去痛苦的样子。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1521}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "也是爱让人迸发出无穷的力量，创造惊人的奇迹的样子。", "char_start": 1522, "char_end": 1547}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "是它修复、温养、治愈巨大的精神创伤，实现人与人之间强大的支撑的样子。", "char_start": 1548, "char_end": 1582}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "几乎可以说一切的抑郁、绝望，面对这样决绝、赤诚的爱，都是无法无动于衷的。", "char_start": 1583, "char_end": 1619}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "完全迸发的自觉的、成熟的爱，真足以安抚世上一切的心痛，是可以极大的消除掉“在一起很痛苦”的效应的。", "char_start": 1620, "char_end": 1669}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "即使这爱里有痛苦，你也会看到这痛苦不来自对方的加害，而是已经因为对方的存在而大大的减轻过了。", "char_start": 1670, "char_end": 1716}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "如果不是这样，如果对方的存在不但没有消减痛苦，反而对方常常是加害的一方——甚至更糟，处心积虑的制造着让你无法离开的法律上、契约上的障碍，让你有被陷阱抓住、无法脱身的患难——那么你就不必纠结了，一定要选择果断脱身。", "char_start": 1717, "char_end": 1823}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "反过来，如果是这样，对方也已经极大的消解了来自外部的痛苦，只是经过消解你仍然客观上承受不起——例如对方患上了不能共处的传染病、或者惹上了足以株连家人的灾难——你仍然可以分手，而此时对方不但不会反对，还会给你祝福。", "char_start": 1824, "char_end": 1930}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "因为ta也爱你。", "char_start": 1931, "char_end": 1939}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "参考给你了，自问心境合乎多少吧。", "char_start": 1940, "char_end": 1956}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 57}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：和男朋友在一起很痛苦，该不该果断分手呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056"], "summary": "围绕“无苦之乐”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“爱时常会有牺牲，但出于爱的牺牲本身一定是甜蜜的、快乐的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "爱时常会有牺牲，但出于爱的牺牲本身一定是甜蜜的、快乐的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cb9964b0-6a32-5868-a88c-2b80509612e8", "source_ordinal": 303, "reading_ordinal": 3754, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不认不可", "published_at": "2026-02-22T07:13:29.773000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2001101119670210980/answer/2005886489012236714"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "小时候就不说了，家里的确给我拿过学费，但是后来基本都是靠我自己在社会上摸爬滚打的，我也不开口找人借钱，真需要钱了，也是去撸网贷，在钱的事上能不求人就不求人，靠自己买的房子，车子，虽然也不值什么钱，半年攒了十五万左右，（为什么只有半年，因为上半年在还网贷，没能攒下钱，一直到六七月份，才开始慢慢攒下钱的），我感觉自己很厉害了，我看超哥超车的时候，他也说我这种人算人中龙凤了（二三十岁，有车有房，没贷款，有十万以上的存款，他视频里的原话），然后吧，他们还说身边人多厉害，自己老弟在酒吧随随便便敲敲架子鼓就有九千多，然后自己什么什么同学，985毕业，一个月一两万的工资，然后我说，我收入比你身边人都高，为啥", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 348, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你定义的“认可”是什么？", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是要人向你拱手为礼，有所敬拜。一定要到这个地步，你才确认这是有所认可。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但其实你仔细想想，一叫就来，这是不是认可？来和你见面是要花时间的，要耽误别的事的，还要冒和你处不好的风险、要承担你可能有的各种礼仪要求。人家没有问“有没有什么好处”，你一个电话，人家就来了。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这是不是认可？", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你一问，人家就回答你了。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一开口，就给你回应，这算不算认可？", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你要知道人家真要不想理你，有的是你无法追究的理由。“忙”“刚好有事”“不巧别人先跟我约了”“手机没弹提示/不在身边”……人家不是非要理你不可的。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然而你一搭话，人家就回复了。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "对不认可的人会这样吗？", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你看出问题来没有？", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你把“被认可”的标准拔得太高了，把别人承担的风险、付出的努力看得太轻了，把很多东西看成了“正常往来的天然义务”而完全没有作价。那些努力和风险，人家付出了只被视为理所当然，不给反而要招怨，被视为“一点面子也不给”。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是因为你把基线直接划高了。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "心里要装着别人的疾苦，明白吗？要知道人的生命是无价的，哪怕和你说一句话、跟你见一个面，都是不折不扣的用生命在认可你。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 823}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "哪怕是十几秒，那也是再也追不回的生命啊，就这么给你了，没得到你什么涌泉相报的担保就给了，这样的认可，一定不能因为它看上去经常发生而给予轻视。", "char_start": 824, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一旦你正确的调整了你的标准，你就再也不会缺“被认可感”。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 923}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "每一个停下来跟你打招呼的人，都认可了你。", "char_start": 924, "char_end": 944}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "每一个专门来赴约的人，都认可了你。", "char_start": 945, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "每一个专门和你说话、为你的情绪给你解释、顾虑你可能误解的人，都认可了你。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你所称之为“认可”的东西，其实应该叫“崇敬”。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1023}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "人的认可其实是人的精神健康的必需品，缺了人就会沮丧，也该沮丧，但这是极少才会出现的极端危局。", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1070}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而人没有“崇敬”，并无大碍，实属平常。", "char_start": 1071, "char_end": 1090}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对自己用错了词绝不是一件小事。", "char_start": 1091, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "用错词，定错性，感错情，这是人生痛苦的最大来源之一。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "以后感到痛苦、纠结，第一件事就要先反思自己的定性、用词。注意接受教训呀。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1170}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：感觉老是得不到身边人的认可，亲戚也好，朋友也好，就是感觉他们老是不愿意认可我，这是为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“不认不可”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“小时候就不说了，家里的确给我拿过学费，但是后来基本都是靠我自己在社会上摸爬滚打的，我也不开口找人借钱，真需要钱了，也是去撸网贷，在钱的事上能不求人就不求人，靠自己买的房子，车子，虽然也不值什么钱，半年攒了十五万左右，（为什么只有半年，因为上半年在还网贷，没能攒下钱，一直到六七月份，才开始慢慢攒下钱的），我感觉自己很厉害了，我看超哥超车的时候，他也说我这种人算”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "小时候就不说了，家里的确给我拿过学费，但是后来基本都是靠我自己在社会上摸爬滚打的，我也不开口找人借钱，真需要钱了，也是去撸网贷，在钱的事上能不求人就不求人，靠自己买的房子，车子，虽然也不值什么钱，半年攒了十五万左右，（为什么只有半年，因为上半年在还网贷，没能攒下钱，一直到六七月份，才开始慢慢攒下钱的），我感觉自己很厉害了，我看超哥超车的时候，他也说我这种人算", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 348, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "69a5f21a-0a81-5461-b421-b5fa8416e783", "source_ordinal": 302, "reading_ordinal": 3755, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天光", "published_at": "2026-02-23T00:13:13.531000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2003815708405040927/answer/2005652036855800870"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "最早是因为天光。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "农业时代“日出而作、日落而息”是很重要的，因为这段时间有免费的天光可用。一旦进入夜晚，再想看见东西就需要烧燃料了，而这些照明燃料都是要花力气收集、花钱去买的。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是一份额外的开销，对于普遍并不那么宽裕的劳动人民来说，自然是能省就省了。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "既然如此，太阳刚刚要越过地平线，人就要趁着蒙蒙亮的时候起床吃早餐了。带上干粮走一二里地到自家地头上，刚好天光大亮，清晨时分又不太热，正好劳动起来。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果不早起，这段时间就利用不上，原本五天可干完的活，可能就要六七天才能干完。这是决定秋天能收多少粮食、雨季到来前能不能重铺屋顶、能不能及时卖掉家里的粮产、织物，决定家里生活水平的大事，所以当然要紧了。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "现在则是怕你脱离社会。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不管你自己是怎么安排作息，整个社会毕竟是从早高峰忙到晚高峰的。你能遇见的人、能经历的事、能产生的羁绊、能结的缘分，大多都在这段时间、在你的门外发生着。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果你总是下午才起床，甚至是依赖着家庭供养，一直昼伏夜出，父母长辈们会非常担心你与真实的、有血有肉的人结缘不足。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "怕你错过真实的生命啊。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta们更希望你有更多能坐在一起说话，能手牵手、肩并肩的活生生的朋友，能在你头疼脑热时真的出现在你身边的爱人，而不是一旦言语不合，只要手指一划就能把道歉的机会都抹去的电子朋友。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为ta们没法陪你一辈子，所以希望你有一些真实的依靠。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta们想要你在尽量早的年纪开始积累这些缘分，因为你还需要很多练习才能学会好好的维持你的社会网络。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ta们是好心来的。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对不对再说，我也明白你可能很烦。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是别真的怪ta们，也想想ta们这忧虑的道理吧。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "其实我在考虑怎么能让你们——我是说我们素问村的朋友们——有机会成为真实生活里的有缘人。", "char_start": 677, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "怎么能引导你们既有恰当的、轻松的、收放自如的交往，又不至于因为掌握不好分寸而轻易的磨损了这番机缘。", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个时代，大家真的太孤独了。只是在评论区偶尔点头之交，这样的缘分其实太薄、太容易因为一时的忙碌而湮灭。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而从孤独中一下子因为渴望而紧紧地互相交结，又容易因为一时过度的炽烈，反而在短时间内就产生疲劳和困扰。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我不停的写，其实是想以身为桥，让你们可以不断在我的评论区相聚、时时看见彼此，也因为不同的回答主题，时时有新鲜的谈资。能一直为你们开着这些窗，让你们知道自己并不孤单，有很多同伴。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "我的“洞见”，我的“才华”，我的“影响力”其实根本就不重要，也不是我在写这些东西的时候在尝试塑造的东西。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我在想的是——也许你们有人对这个会感兴趣，会因为这个遇到另一个也对此感兴趣的人。也许你们遇见多了，就会成为朋友，以后会互相激励、互相陪伴。", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而我这些主题背后的总的价值观，可以大概的让你期待这些朋友们会是相对更温柔、更公正、更有能力的，是能为彼此带去能量而不是彼此消耗的。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1151}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这其实和“唠唠叨叨希望你能早起”的人们是一样的心情。", "char_start": 1152, "char_end": 1178}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "甚至，我们的早餐行动就是在做这件事啊。", "char_start": 1179, "char_end": 1198}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "关于每天的早安", "char_start": 1199, "char_end": 1206}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "所以，还是那句话——", "char_start": 1207, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我明白你可能会觉得烦，但是别真的怪ta们。", "char_start": 1218, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "ta们是好意来的。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1249}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "也许你真的可以考虑一下。", "char_start": 1250, "char_end": 1262}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "别的不说，我们村里是有很多朋友会欢迎你的。", "char_start": 1263, "char_end": 1284}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老一辈为何对子女「睡懒觉」有很强的执念，这反映了怎样的代际差异？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“天光”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“最早是因为天光。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "最早是因为天光。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0f2d3529-3ca5-5f48-8dfa-58bb77ca47c0", "source_ordinal": 301, "reading_ordinal": 3756, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "赛的是人", "published_at": "2026-02-23T12:47:46.960000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2007141928202937928/answer/2008625393297555960"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这话并不正确。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "赛车运动的组织者自己很清楚，其实比赛还是要比人。如果让车的因素完全抹杀人的因素，搞到人的发挥都不影响结果的地步，比赛就没了。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "射箭比赛要是想的话完全可以在弓把上安装智慧观瞄系统，连风偏和重力修正都给你做了，甚至干脆自动击发，百发百中算了。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "赛车完全可以全自动驾驶，根本不需要车手，顺便还可以把人的体重减掉，行走如飞。但这样一来，比赛就死了。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "国际汽联哪可能这么蠢？ta们会限制车的因素，避免这种砸饭碗的事发生的。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "比如限定排量不得大于1600cc，最大转速不得超过15000转，最低重量不得低于798kg（含车手体重），限制载油量、限制最大输油流量、限制空气动力学设计。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这不是说各个车队不能戴着镣铐跳舞搞出一些技术性优势，但这就像鲨鱼皮泳衣一样，搞过分了就会被禁。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你要搞出什么车手都跑不过的AI汽车，你不被比赛踢出场外，比赛就要被你踢出场外了。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "说到底，比赛最终毕竟比的是人。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "大家来花时间看、用感情去爱的是人。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 416}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《飞驰人生 3》中安部长为什么会认为「赛车赛的只是车」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“赛的是人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这话并不正确。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这话并不正确。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da164ad4-bba4-5cea-8813-aa7317be3173", "source_ordinal": 300, "reading_ordinal": 3757, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "背箱子的人", "published_at": "2026-02-23T13:32:11.567000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/852644173/answer/2005787349456548504"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这应该是一个有趣的统计错觉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你看到中国人背包的时候不会在意，因为这时候ta们只是街上的路人，地铁里的上班族，校门口的孩子……当你注意到ta们的旅行装备时，往往是在机场、车站。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而反过来，你在机场、车站时，往往很少看到外国人。遇到外国人概率最大的地方反而是在你家附近的景点附近。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实无论国内国外，总的规律都是搭乘长途航班、火车的做远程旅行时因为行李太多、场站区域内地面光滑而多用旅行箱，而到达目的地、在附近访问活动时因为太多上坎下阶而喜欢轻便的背包。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "短途旅行只带少量物品，谁也不会用一个大箱子。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "拖着旅行箱逛街是非常难受的，而背着近一周的换洗衣服、办公装备、各种家当也是累死个人，中外皆然，没有什么文化差别。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只是这个认知差异的产生机制，真的有趣。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 326}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国人旅游喜欢拖箱子，外国人喜欢背包，这是为什么呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“背箱子的人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这应该是一个有趣的统计错觉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这应该是一个有趣的统计错觉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8fe7f224-3743-5c7a-bf84-65071f35efd6", "source_ordinal": 297, "reading_ordinal": 3758, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "虎斑观音", "published_at": "2026-02-23T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1916980719818904615/answer/2005272722423423017"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“人生容错率大”的原理是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果你不解决掉这个原理，或者这个原理经不起考验，这个讲述是没有价值的，也是没有效果的。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "先谈最流行的思路：", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "父母为了刺激孩子学习，极力主张“没有任何人靠得住，你只有靠自己”“没人真的在乎别人，只有真本事最重要”“世上只有我们对你是真心的”“天下没有白吃的午餐”“天上不会掉馅饼”……", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "先把这侥幸心消灭掉。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "既然无可侥幸，你的能力就要可以做到无限的趋吉避凶，永远选对答案、超过标准、胜过对手、猜对趋势。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦你的能力不足了，你选错答案、低于标准、输给对手、猜错趋势了，你就要退而求其次，相信“世界容错率高”。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个就是父母们希望做到的整体安排。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这时候最诡异的矛盾来了——之前为了刺激你积极的发展自己的能力，家里特别强化过“不允许期待任何天上掉馅饼”的训练，确保过你绝对不会保持一点这种妄想，这样你才会像被老虎追逐一样拼命的锻炼能力。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "现在你吃了败仗了，却又要你去相信天上会掉馅饼，而且会经常掉、必然掉、马上就会掉——即所谓的“容错性高”。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "前面亲手拆毁的，这时候却拿来作为“容错率高”的担保。你让这个受了半辈子“无馅饼教育”的孩子怎么同时去相信两个自相矛盾的教导？", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "看出问题来了吗？", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "注意，这里绝不是在说“天上掉馅饼”式的运气客观上不存在，这当然是存在的，而且的确值得处在绝境中的人引以为最后的安慰，支撑自己保持乐观。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "问题不出在这好运不存在，而出在这类教育框架之前将其视为“容易导致消极和侥幸心理”的祸害，自己清除过。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "又怕侥幸会伤害孩子的动力，又想要侥幸来保住孩子的韧性。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 654}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "指望着昨天的洪水猛兽来当今天的救世观音。", "char_start": 655, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这虎斑的观音吊睛白额，好一张血盆大口，不知是要来济世度人，还是来超度亡魂。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "框架原理错了，自然结果就难以期待了。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "其实人生的容错率到底有多大，能容得下你多少失败，最根本的逻辑是看你的社会安全网有多大，有多结实。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你背后有一大群能人异士，随时随地能给你个沙发栖身，能给你点活糊口，能给你消息和资源让你插一脚、分一杯羹，那么只要世界风云变幻没有导致这些人全体覆灭，你就总有容身退步之所，东山再起之机，也就是容错率确实真的大。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这够朴素吧？", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而这背后是你有很强的能力降低人的戒心、获得人的信任、得到人的关切和支持。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 933}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "是因为你的这个能力强大，你这样的体验丰厚，以至于你对人性会有信心——你会相信要得到帮助、得到友情并不困难，相信世界上到处都有友善可爱的人，你自会有超出自己能力之外的乐观。", "char_start": 934, "char_end": 1019}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这个就是关键——超出自己能力之外的乐观。", "char_start": 1020, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "乐观不超出自己的能力是没啥用的，因为你一失败你的能力就失败了，连带那份无法超越你的能力的乐观一起完蛋了。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1093}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "只有超出自己能力的乐观，能让人真的相信“即使我的能力搞不定，也还是可以搞定”，才真的产生这份容错率自信。", "char_start": 1094, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这样才能在自己的无能被证实之后，人仍然能保持足够的乐观和积极。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1178}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而这份信心，这份乐观，真正的基石其实是通过家庭教育塑造出来的一份极其善于获得友谊、维持好意的高度社会性的人格结构。", "char_start": 1179, "char_end": 1236}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "孩子走出去，不管成绩好坏，同学爱和ta玩，有人欺负ta就有朋友挺身而出，就算学习一般老师仍然喜欢，大家莫名其妙总盼着ta好，亲近ta，挂念ta，乐于出力帮助ta，这孩子不必任何人再去说服，就自然而然会相信人生的容错率很高。", "char_start": 1237, "char_end": 1348}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这才是解决安全感危机的正道。", "char_start": 1349, "char_end": 1363}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这就是为什么我们花了这么多年的时间，要用几千个答案来构建这份爱与被爱的教育框架。", "char_start": 1364, "char_end": 1404}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "真正要去构建子女的韧性，要讲的不是“天上也是会掉馅饼的”——这可以讲讲，但是你自己也会体会到这副作用很大。", "char_start": 1405, "char_end": 1458}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "真该讲的，是怎么对待朋友，怎么对待陌生人，怎么对待信任，怎么判定善意，怎么激励别人对自己的关心……", "char_start": 1459, "char_end": 1508}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "怎么暖人心、怎么得情谊。", "char_start": 1509, "char_end": 1521}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "是实实在在的帮孩子交上好朋友，好师长，让ta认识到人何时恐惧、何时猜疑，何时慷慨，何时义愤，让ta活在友情中，活在对人的信心中。", "char_start": 1522, "char_end": 1586}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "注意，这份信心绝不是简单的童话式的乡愿，即把每个人都看成活菩萨降世，那是极其容易幻灭而走向绝望的。", "char_start": 1587, "char_end": 1636}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这份信心是建立在接受客观真实的人性的基础上，看到对方并不完美的行为之下那些真正的闪光，学会捕捉和滋养那些种子，像一个熟练的农民一样将它们培育长大。", "char_start": 1637, "char_end": 1710}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这是个基于技能和修炼的信心，而不是基于无知和天真的信心。", "char_start": 1711, "char_end": 1739}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "是在你掌握了这些技能和经验的前提下，真正认识到世界的容错率确实大。", "char_start": 1740, "char_end": 1773}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "这些技能其实相当复杂，否则也不至于我们要花上七年，写几千个答案来讲、以后还要这样讲下去了。", "char_start": 1774, "char_end": 1819}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "就写到这里。", "char_start": 1820, "char_end": 1826}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "希望你们都能得到这份信心。", "char_start": 1827, "char_end": 1840}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：到底有没有办法让还没有踏上社会的孩子明白一个道理「人生的容错率是很大的」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042"], "summary": "围绕“虎斑观音”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““人生容错率大”的原理是什么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“人生容错率大”的原理是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f784d9d0-16ce-5fcb-9d22-77e05a828dca", "source_ordinal": 298, "reading_ordinal": 3759, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "租面人", "published_at": "2026-02-23T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2004629058894389561/answer/2004885376368652458"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题不会延续很久的，很快就会有想出名的明星、cosplayer以及虚拟角色宣布开源自己的肖像权，允许他人自由使用或以极低价格取得自己的肖像授权，只要求标注来源、或要求角色名必须采用指定名称即可。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这其中完全可能包含和明星长得极像的自然人——到时候这笔生意怎么算、怎么判，真的是版权法历史上的新挑战。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "脑子转得快的ip持有者，尤其是一些二线明星、模特很快就会行动起来的，接着不少一线明星都会加入，只是一线明星需要专门申请一下罢了，价钱可能低到不过1000块——主要是一个审核内容的人工成本。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "甚至平台还会专门经营这个业务——自然人出租肖像权，然后创作者可以直接在官方提供的角色库里付费“选演员”，肖像出租者直接按时长和次数收费，并且保留一定的向平台申诉撤销授权的权利。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个业务恐怕不过一个月就会出现。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "看吧。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这不会阻挡AI大潮的。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 368}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：周星驰经纪人质疑短视频平台对 AI 生成视频侵权放任不管，这触犯了哪些法律红线？平台该如何管理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“租面人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题不会延续很久的，很快就会有想出名的明星、cosplayer以及虚拟角色宣布开源自己的肖像权，允许他人自由使用或以极低价格取得自己的肖像授权，只要求标注来源、或要求角色名必须采用指定名称即可。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题不会延续很久的，很快就会有想出名的明星、cosplayer以及虚拟角色宣布开源自己的肖像权，允许他人自由使用或以极低价格取得自己的肖像授权，只要求标注来源、或要求角色名必须采用指定名称即可。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 99, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fc18c411-c7ec-5199-a528-0827c9aa803e", "source_ordinal": 299, "reading_ordinal": 3760, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "布老虎", "published_at": "2026-02-23T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/664314645/answer/2005707619080356140"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题下，有一个很值得探讨的现象，就是心理专家要治疗抑郁，矫正行为，往往不如一位有名的神婆、巫师一句“这是丢了魂，戴上这个符，每天晚上都吃三颗豆子”来得立竿见影、效果显著。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这问题其实原理很唯物——", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这就像一匹马总会被一丛青草吸引去啃吃，然后总是中毒。一般的心理咨询师总想要向这匹马解释这丛青草里具体有什么毒，怎么让你中的毒，希望说服马自己懂得不要去吃这个草。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但这对马来说难如登天——因为马看不出这丛草和别的草到底有何本质区别。难道只要马儿跑，马儿戒掉所有草？", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而宗教大师们则简单得多，ta们直接弄个老虎玩偶趴在这丛草上。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实这个老虎玩偶只是很逼真、不会真的吃掉马，但是它改变马的行为的效果要远远的胜过给马上毒理课。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至马越是不了解这老虎玩偶怎么做的，效果越好。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "信仰文化里有大量这种工具可用，其实要比现代心理学、认知行为学的工具强大得多。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "现代医学出于法律伦理的问题，只能限制自身，仅仅使用知的力量，指望依靠知的力量，将责任转移到获得知识后作出自主决定的患者身上。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但这些大师们使用的是无知的力量，一种比知的力量更强、只是会产生巨大法律风险的力量。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现代化否定了无知，而仅存的知却对这类问题效力低下，甚至根本无效。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这其实在某种意义上是现代性的悲剧了。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 531}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0536"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子抑郁厌学，为什么看了心理医生还是收效甚微？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“布老虎”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题下，有一个很值得探讨的现象，就是心理专家要治疗抑郁，矫正行为，往往不如一位有名的神婆、巫师一句“这是丢了魂，戴上这个符，每天晚上都吃三颗豆子”来得立竿见影、效果显著。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题下，有一个很值得探讨的现象，就是心理专家要治疗抑郁，矫正行为，往往不如一位有名的神婆、巫师一句“这是丢了魂，戴上这个符，每天晚上都吃三颗豆子”来得立竿见影、效果显著。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
